  "abstract_summary": "We demonstrate that LongMemEval (ICLR 2025), the de facto standard for evaluating AI agent memory, does not test memory retrieval. Its per-question isolation protocol pre-selects ~50 candidate sessions per question, reducing the task to keyword matching. The same FTS5/BM25 system achieves 94.0% R@5 under the standar...",
